#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:2 67efcbb0eb064867a709d5abb5c13a2a
msgid "eventlet"
msgstr "eventlet"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:4 658c04618eea4e0b99d47f10142a3890
msgid ""
"Prefer using :doc:`gunicorn` with eventlet workers rather than using "
"`eventlet`_ directly. Gunicorn provides a much more configurable and "
"production-tested server."
msgstr ""
"建议使用带有 eventlet worker 的 :doc:`gunicorn`，而不是直接使用 `eventlet`_。"
" Gunicorn 提供了更强的可配置性，并且是经过生产环境验证的服务器。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:8 3b7865f22ea04187831baf727ef2500a
msgid ""
"`eventlet`_ allows writing asynchronous, coroutine-based code that looks "
"like standard synchronous Python. It uses `greenlet`_ to enable task "
"switching without writing ``async/await`` or using ``asyncio``."
msgstr ""
"`eventlet`_ 允许你编写异步、基于协程的代码，并且代码风格看起来就像标准的同步 "
"Python。 它使用 `greenlet`_ 实现任务切换，无需编写 ``async/await`` 或使用 "
"``asyncio``。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:12
#: 53b0af9052134a9e9a5e79155af4efb6
msgid ""
":doc:`gevent` is another library that does the same thing. Certain "
"dependencies you have, or other considerations, may affect which of the "
"two you choose to use."
msgstr ":doc:`gevent` 是另一个具有相同功能的库。 "
"你使用的某些依赖或其他因素可能会影响你选择其中哪一个。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:16
#: a52aa2eb9c9a49f38f9861c0d3b2d8dd
msgid ""
"eventlet provides a WSGI server that can handle many connections at once "
"instead of one per worker process. You must actually use eventlet in your"
" own code to see any benefit to using the server."
msgstr ""
"eventlet 提供了一个 WSGI "
"服务器，能够同时处理多个连接，而不是每个工作进程仅处理一个连接。 "
"但要真正获得 eventlet 的好处，你必须在自己的代码中实际使用它。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:25
#: f47d6b1b86954fd7936767ea572c6430
msgid "Installing"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:27
#: fff0a7ef04504451838e722b72162b56
msgid ""
"When using eventlet, greenlet>=1.0 is required, otherwise context locals "
"such as ``request`` will not work as expected. When using PyPy, "
"PyPy>=7.3.7 is required."
msgstr ""
"使用 eventlet 时需要安装 greenlet>=1.0，否则上下文变量（如 "
"``request``）将无法正常工作。 如果使用 PyPy，则需要 PyPy>=7.3.7。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:31
#: 7d26bd13cd3e4ab194339652f7b08a35
msgid "Create a virtualenv, install your application, then install ``eventlet``."
msgstr "创建一个虚拟环境，安装你的应用，然后再安装 ``eventlet``。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:44
#: bda6199f6b1d4cf6a9ddb9952e2b5ecb
msgid "Running"
msgstr "运行"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:46
#: 026e7eb7583a40bbb675f6ae5a320852
msgid ""
"To use eventlet to serve your application, write a script that imports "
"its ``wsgi.server``, as well as your app or app factory."
msgstr "要使用 eventlet 来运行你的应用，请编写一个脚本，导入其 "
"``wsgi.server``，以及你的应用或应用工厂。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:49
#: 3ba3383ad9834a498e315a5c6319b4bb
msgid "``wsgi.py``"
msgstr "``wsgi.py``"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:66
#: 181924244c3a49348e4dce9570c96b4b
msgid "Binding Externally"
msgstr "外部绑定"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:68
#: df99d898e86346088bbad04b3a22b2f3
msgid ""
"eventlet should not be run as root because it would cause your "
"application code to run as root, which is not secure. However, this means"
" it will not be possible to bind to port 80 or 443. Instead, a reverse "
"proxy such as :doc:`nginx` or :doc:`apache-httpd` should be used in front"
" of eventlet."
msgstr ""
"**eventlet 不应以 root 用户身份运行**，因为这样会导致你的应用代码也以 root "
"身份运行，这是不安全的。 但这也意味着你无法绑定到 80 或 443 端口。 相反，"
"应该在 eventlet 前面加一个反向代理，比如 :doc:`nginx` 或 :doc:`apache-"
"httpd`。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:74
#: 5c7ee169b2054b3fb1bf67c96db838d4
msgid ""
"You can bind to all external IPs on a non-privileged port by using "
"``0.0.0.0`` in the server arguments shown in the previous section. Don't "
"do this when using a reverse proxy setup, otherwise it will be possible "
"to bypass the proxy."
msgstr ""
"你可以通过传入 ``0.0.0.0``（在上一节的 server 参数中）绑定到所有外部 IP "
"的非特权端口。 "
"**如果你使用了反向代理，请不要这样做**，否则可能绕过代理直接访问应用。"

#: ../../project/docs/deploying/eventlet.rst:79
#: a748e961432a444e9d5e9ef9f4ff95c2
msgid ""
"``0.0.0.0`` is not a valid address to navigate to, you'd use a specific "
"IP address in your browser."
msgstr "注意：``0.0.0.0`` 不是一个可以在浏览器中访问的有效地址，浏览器中应使用具体的 "
"IP 地址。"
